#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loopusing-using-the-crrcsim-simulator.rst:5
#: df02982ca81643299573761b15f82761
msgid "Using the CRRCSim simulator"
msgstr "使用 CRRCSim 仿真器"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loopusing-using-the-crrcsim-simulator.rst:7
#: 32f8643bb1f74584bb4d7b4bb9f59d6d
msgid ""
"You can optionally use the CRRCSim flight simulator with ArduPilot SITL. The"
" main advantages of using CRRCSim is that it offers a lot more fixed wing "
"models, and also offers a helicopter simulator."
msgstr ""
"您可以选择将 CRRCSim 飞行仿真器与 ArduPilot SITL 配合使用。使用 CRRCSim "
"的主要优点是它提供了更多固定翼模型，同时还提供直升机仿真器。"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loopusing-using-the-crrcsim-simulator.rst:12
#: ddbc181cb23b4361bbe877f078ce3818
msgid "Installing CRRCSim"
msgstr "安装 CRRCSim"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loopusing-using-the-crrcsim-simulator.rst:14
#: 86552c6dc81c4b6c9e19ea3c4dabc2e4
msgid ""
"The CRRCSim simulator has been modified for use by ArduPilot SITL. To "
"install it on Linux you need to do the following:"
msgstr "CRRCSim 仿真器已经过修改以供 ArduPilot SITL 使用。要在 Linux 上安装，需要执行以下步骤："

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loopusing-using-the-crrcsim-simulator.rst:17
#: 1e2b5d30351b4914a19b8ec938b4a9fc
msgid "Add dependencies"
msgstr "添加依赖项"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loopusing-using-the-crrcsim-simulator.rst:24
#: bf4cfc25ce394384aa3a300d5edcbcc5
msgid "To download code and build"
msgstr "下载代码并构建"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loopusing-using-the-crrcsim-simulator.rst:35
#: 4571f74e7b5940c8971013e120747808
msgid ""
"That will install crrcsim in /usr/local/bin. You may find you are missing "
"some packages needed for CRRCSim at the configure stage."
msgstr "这将把 crrcsim 安装到 /usr/local/bin。在配置阶段，您可能发现缺少 CRRCSim 所需的某些软件包。"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loopusing-using-the-crrcsim-simulator.rst:39
#: c48ec06ff24348a5837a9fe81defdd5f
msgid "Running SITL with CRRCSim"
msgstr "使用 CRRCSim 运行 SITL"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loopusing-using-the-crrcsim-simulator.rst:41
#: c6668892435741e286e523c8b7b6adb9
msgid "One crrcsim is installed you can launch it by running:"
msgstr "安装好 crrcsim 后，可以通过运行以下命令启动："

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loopusing-using-the-crrcsim-simulator.rst:47
#: bd8fd4c67b1847358ea46b9b8f2a667b
msgid ""
"that starts CRRCSim with the APM protocol interface. You can then press "
"ESCAPE to bring up the menu and choose an aircraft to simulate. Many of the "
"aircraft will work with SITL, but for ones without motors (the gliders) you "
"will need to choose a launch location on a slope."
msgstr ""
"这将以 APM 协议接口启动 CRRCSim。然后按 Escape 键打开菜单，选择要仿真的飞行器。许多飞行器可以与 SITL "
"配合使用，但对于没有电机的飞行器（滑翔机），您需要在坡地上选择一个发射位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loopusing-using-the-crrcsim-simulator.rst:52
#: bd0f28d13e894eee9717dcbf942fbde8
msgid ""
"For fixed wing testing it is recommended you start with the \"Sport\" "
"aircraft. That simulates a small nitro sport aircraft."
msgstr "固定翼测试建议从「Sport」飞行器开始，它模拟一架小型硝基运动飞机。"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loopusing-using-the-crrcsim-simulator.rst:55
#: 3688acab5bf94844954bb1d206000beb
msgid "For helicopter testing choose the \"Heli-APM\" model."
msgstr "直升机测试选择「Heli-APM」模型。"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loopusing-using-the-crrcsim-simulator.rst:57
#: 80e46d89477540c5a07c3249812be566
msgid ""
"After you have launched CRRCSim you need to start SITL. For fixed wing "
"testing use the \"-f CRRCSim\" option to sim_vehicle.py:"
msgstr "启动 CRRCSim 后，需要启动 SITL。固定翼测试使用 sim_vehicle.py 的「-f CRRCSim」选项："

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loopusing-using-the-crrcsim-simulator.rst:66
#: bfe0175a24a74d17867d257f5c9ef977
msgid "Simulating a helicopter"
msgstr "直升机仿真"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loopusing-using-the-crrcsim-simulator.rst:68
#: 901602dcfcdd4e489814344226e07afa
msgid "For helicopter testing with CRRCSim use \"-f CRRCSim-heli\""
msgstr "使用 CRRCSim 进行直升机测试，使用「-f CRRCSim-heli」参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/simulation-2sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loopusing-using-the-crrcsim-simulator.rst:75
#: 67faf27f1d55487ea02a5a74381b44b1
msgid "The helicopter will have the RSC speed on channel 8."
msgstr "直升机的 RSC 转速将在第 8 通道上输出。"
